Kioku builds PyQt6 6.11.0 (the version Anki pins) against the Termux
repositories' Qt 6.12, which removed QEvent::EnterEditFocus and LeaveEditFocus
(PyQt6 6.12 has them only for Qt < 6.12). Drop with Qt 6.11.

--- a/sip/QtCore/qcoreevent.sip	2026-11-22 19:17:31
+++ b/sip/QtCore/qcoreevent.sip	2026-11-22 19:17:31
@@ -200,8 +200,6 @@
         PlatformSurface,
         TabletTrackingChange,
         GraphicsSceneLeave,
-        EnterEditFocus,
-        LeaveEditFocus,
 %If (Qt_6_6_0 -)
         DevicePixelRatioChange,
 %End
